  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 103.11 General permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 103.11 “General permit” means “general permit” as defined in RSA 149-M:4, IX-b, namely “a permit which contains terms and conditions applicable to a specific category of facility, which applies to any facility in that category which has submitted the required information and agreed to abide by the stated terms and conditions.”\n\nSource. #14103, effective 10-23-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
